          <h1>Run Qwen3.5 locally on your Mac</h1>
          <p class="dek">A short guide to choosing a model and running it on Apple Silicon.</p>
          <div class="metadata">
            <time datetime="2026-03-01">March 1, 2026</time>
            <span>Updated April 18, 2026</span>
            <span class="tag">Qwen3.5</span>
          </div>
